      "text": "Created 10 Jun 2015 : 日本語 , 한국어 0 0 Duqu 2.0, the cyberespionage tool that was used to compromise security firm Kaspersky Lab, has also been used in a number of other attack campaigns against a range of targets, including several telecoms firms.",
